### Cross-Functional Dependencies

The technology innovation and r&d roadmap initiative requires close coordination across multiple business units and functional areas:

**Engineering Integration:**
The engineering team led by CTO Dr. Evelyn Reed provides technical oversight and R&D support. Key engineering dependencies include design specifications for SkyLink Satellite Network, integration with NexGen Battery Storage, and technology transfer from the Orion Logistics Center - Singapore. Engineering resources are allocated at 18% capacity, with critical path activities including system architecture design, prototype development, and validation testing.

**Operations Coordination:**
COO Alex Thorne oversees operational execution including manufacturing scale-up, supply chain management, and quality assurance. The operations team coordinates with GreenTech Materials for component sourcing and SecureCode Systems for logistics support. Production ramp-up is scheduled for 2025-02-06 with target capacity of 1132 units annually.

